!!! Class chain

Notice the styling: {!.indent.b classed inline span!} continues.

!!! Bare letters after open are interpreted as a symbol

Because `{!body!}` has no space after the open, `body` is consumed as a symbol-name. With nothing registered for it, the span is empty: a {!body!} b

''Workaround:'' put a space, like {! body !}.